OL,3,GNEWSAChildren's new wheelchairs taken  
OL,4,Ain van theft                           
OL,6,FThieves have stolen a van carrying six 
OL,7,Fbespoke wheelchairs due to be delivered
OL,8,Fto children to give them life-changing 
OL,9,Findependence and confidence, a charity 
OL,10,Fsaid.                                  
OL,12,FThe Whizz Kidz van, which was loaded   
OL,13,Fwith the chairs that are worth about   
OL,14,F#60,000, was taken from the Lanesfield 
OL,15,Farea of Wolverhampton in the early     
OL,16,Fhours, and police are investigating.   
OL,18,FThe chairs were to be given to the     
OL,19,Fchildren within hours, leaving excited 
OL,20,Ffamilies devastated to hear the news   
OL,21,Ffrom the charity.                      
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
